  "full_passage_spoken": "I go fishing with my grandpa. We sit by the lake. I hold a rod. We wait, and we are quiet. I catch a small fish. Grandpa has a smile. Fishing makes me patient. The lake is calm in the morning. A patient person can wait with a rod. The small fish goes back into the lake. Grandpa's smile says I did well.",
  "topic_zh": "去钓鱼",
  "topic_pinyin": "qù diào yú",
  "voice_zh": "zh-CN-XiaoxiaoNeural",
  "full_passage_zh": "我和爷爷一起去钓鱼。我们坐在湖边。我拿着鱼竿。我们等着，也很安静。我钓到一条小鱼。爷爷露出微笑。钓鱼让我变得有耐心。早上的湖很平静。有耐心的人可以拿着鱼竿等。小鱼回到湖里。爷爷的微笑是在说我做得好。",
